     1,
     "<div dir=\"auto\">Have you tried SSimp? It allows imputation from summary statistics. Should solve your problem<div><br></div><div>Best</div><div><br></div><div>N<br><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://github.com/zkutalik/ssimp_software\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/zkutalik/ssimp_software&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793237639616000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1xgh97kiYYFMP5gMEFZfQj\">https://github.com/zkutalik/ssimp_software</a><br><br><div dir=\"ltr\">Sent from my iPhone</div><div dir=\"ltr\"><br><blockquote type=\"cite\">On 11 Oct 2021, at 20:34, &#39;Källberg Zvrskovec, Johan&#39; via Genomic SEM Users &lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">genomic-...@googlegroups.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br><br></blockquote></div><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div dir=\"ltr\">﻿\r\n\r\n</div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
    ],
